OL,3,GNEWSADrug-dealing footballer made over
OL,4,A#170K, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footballer who bragged on Instagram
OL,7,Fabout his drug dealing made more than
OL,8,F#170,000 from his crimes, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FThierry Nevers, 24, who previously
OL,12,Fplayed for West Ham, Newport County and
OL,13,FBradford City, pleaded guilty to
OL,14,Fconspiracy to supply Class A drugs and
OL,15,Fwas jailed for three years at Lincoln
OL,16,FCrown Court in December.
OL,18,FFollowing the conviction, a Proceeds of
OL,19,FCrime Act investigation was ordered to
OL,20,Fwork out how much money he made from
OL,21,Fcriminal activity and to recover any
OL,22,Favailable assets.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
