OL,3,GNEWSADrug-dealing footballer made over
OL,4,A#170K, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincoln Crown Court heard on Monday it
OL,7,Fwas agreed Nevers made a benefit of
OL,8,F#171,000 from his drug dealing, but had
OL,9,Favailable assets of only #32,678.
